# Full screening q mesh by default. To start adaptive refinement, uncomment:
# wannier-koopmans-screening-mesh 4 4 4
# Each dimension must divide common.in's kpoint-folding. The k integration,
# orbital sources, bare KI Hamiltonian and output bands keep the full mesh.
# The initial mesh refines with response reuse (default tolerance 0.005 eV).
# Append 0 to the command only for a fixed-mesh diagnostic.
